        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Sergey Cheremencev",
          "email": "scherementsev@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-11-23 15:09:36.000000000",
          "tz": 180
        },
        "subject": "LU-18222 utils: don't allow -v with lfs quota --lqa",
        "message": "LU-18222 utils: don't allow -v with lfs quota --lqa\n\nPer-target quota info is not available for LQA, as only the QMT\nknows which IDs belong to an LQA.  \"lfs quota -v --lqa\" sent\nLUSTRE_Q_GETQUOTALQA with QC_MDTIDX/QC_OSTIDX to every target and\nfailed with \"quotactl mdtN/ostN failed.\" for each of them.  Reject\n-v when --lqa is specified.\n\nAlso remove the stray \"%d\" that printed inacc at the beginning of\nthe \"Some errors happened when getting quota info\" message.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota\nFixes: ae7c99ac87a0 (\"LU-18222 quota: add LQA lfs setquota/quota commands\")\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ic57c36c0212c1aec674acbee901c1c0c492e449e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
